#------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
#                                                                              #
#                          README - rodMaker                                   #
#                                                                              #
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------#

This folder contains the python script rodMaker.py used to generate 1-D or 2-D
blockMesh geometries for OFFBEAT

Content of the folder:
	
	- rodDict : python dictionary - input file for rodMaker

	- rodMaker.py : python script that reads rodDict and generate blockMeshDict
					file

================================================================================

Example of execution:

  'python rodMaker.py'

================================================================================
